title Vinyl P2b: without udisks2 the drives are listed and a tap says what is missing (640x480 at the deck's own density, 11.3 px/mm: allow-small)
sizes 640x480
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library
env VINYL_DEMO_DRIVES nodisks
keyboards 1
wait 1200
tap "Folders"
wait 700
tap "Generic Flash Disk"
wait 900
shot 01-notice
expect text "Drives need the udisks2 package."
expect text "USB DRIVES"
expect text "Generic Flash Disk"
expect noquit
